shortcut-manager (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial official release of Shortcut Manager (Qt6 + C++17).
  * Feature: Automatic application scanning.
  * Feature: Desktop shortcut management (Add, Remove, Refresh).
  * Feature: Full Property Editor & Visual Icon Picker Dialog.
  * Feature: Custom, File, and Folder shortcut creation.
  * Feature: Validator, Pinned apps, and JSON Import/Export.
  * Feature: System Info & About Dialog.

